              text: 'UNIT-3 Yoga About the unit Yoga helps us in developing a healthy body and a healthy mind. Good health, positive behaviour and mental strength are very important for our happiness. These things can be achieved through healthy habits of eating, regular exercise, practicing personal hygiene, thinking positive and being kind to others. In this unit, we will learn about different aspects of Yoga— how to be a sensitive person, how to care for others, how to make our body strong and flexible and how to have a calm mind. Unit Yoga.indd Unit Yoga.indd 10-07-2024 15:49:10 10-07-2024 15:49:10 Being Happy We do many things every day, like playing, gardening, colouring and singing, that make us happy. Tick all the activities that you enjoy.  Gardening  Playing with friends  Playing with pets Yoga for Daily Life YG Unit Yoga.indd Unit Yoga.indd 10-07-2024 15:49:13 10-07-2024 15:49:13 Unit 3: Yoga 1. Do you like any other activities? If yes, write them below. ____________________________________________ ____________________________________________ 2. Share your experiences of happy moments with your friends in the class.  Colouring  Singing and dancing  Playing with water  Eating together at home  Studying  Listening to stories Unit Yoga.indd Unit Yoga.indd 10-07-2024 15:49:17 10-07-2024 15:49:17 Khel Yoga Class Being Healthy Which activities do you think help us to be strong and healthy? Tick them.  Eating nutritious home food  Exercising daily  Practicing cleanliness Cycling Playing games Unit Yoga.indd Unit Yoga.indd 10-07-2024 15:49:19 10-07-2024 15:49:19 Unit 3: Yoga 1. Discuss in pairs about the importance of each activity given above. (a) How do you feel after exercising? (b) How many hours do you play on the ground each day?',
